        "kind": "document",
        "sourceId": "upgrade-notes",
        "uri": "https://github.com/cilium/cilium/blob/v1.17.0/Documentation/operations/upgrade.rst",
        "locator": "L316-L319 (1.17 Upgrade Notes)",
        "excerpt": "* MTU auto-detection will now use the lowest MTU of all external interfaces. Before, only the primary\n  interface was considered. One exception to this is in ENI mode where the secondary interfaces are not\n  considered for MTU auto-detection. MTU can still be configured manually via the `MTU` helm option,\n  `--mtu` agent flag or `mtu` option in CNI configuration.",
